{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1613","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Tree Coloring"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4.5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a rooted tree consisting of $$$n$$$ vertices numbered from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$. The root of the tree is the vertex $$$1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to color all vertices of the tree into $$$n$$$ colors (also numbered from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$) so that there is exactly one vertex for each color. Let $$$c_i$$$ be the color of vertex $$$i$$$, and $$$p_i$$$ be the parent of vertex $$$i$$$ in the rooted tree. The coloring is considered beautiful if there is no vertex $$$k$$$ ($$$k \\gt 1$$$) such that $$$c_k = c_{p_k} - 1$$$, i. e. no vertex such that its color is less than the color of its parent by "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly $$$1$$$"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Calculate the number of beautiful colorings, and print it modulo $$$998244353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 250000$$$) — the number of vertices in the tree."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then $$$n-1$$$ lines follow, the $$$i$$$-th line contains two integers $$$x_i$$$ and $$$y_i$$$ ($$$1 \\le x_i, y_i \\le n$$$; $$$x_i \\ne y_i$$$) denoting an edge between the vertex $$$x_i$$$ and the vertex $$$y_i$$$. These edges form a tree."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer — the number of beautiful colorings, taken modulo $$$998244353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n1 2\n3 2\n4 2\n2 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n42\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n1 2\n2 3\n3 4\n4 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n53\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n20\n20 19\n20 4\n12 4\n5 8\n1 2\n20 7\n3 10\n7 18\n11 8\n9 10\n17 10\n1 15\n11 16\n14 11\n18 10\n10 1\n14 2\n13 17\n20 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n955085064\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1613F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1613/problem/F"}